full-measure Euler derivative == N_x (1 - gamma v^2/N^2) + gamma (N D)_x : True
PN offset   : -2*gamma*v**2*Derivative(phi(x), x)/(phi(x) + 1)**3  -> relative -2*gamma*v**2/(phi(x) + 1)**3
exact offset: -gamma*v**2*Derivative(phi(x), x)/(phi(x) + 1)**2  -> relative -gamma*v**2/(phi(x) + 1)**2
ratio PN/exact at phi->0: 2/(phi(x) + 1)
dL/dN (clock+stiffness) == -sqrt h v^2 (1 - 2 gamma D)/(2 N^2): True
AC8 PN Poisson term: s^2 (1 - 2 gamma div P)/(1+phi)^3 -> same (1 - 2 gamma D) factor, measure power N^-2 vs (1+phi)^-3
